; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Air that had turned sharply cold assailed us.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡駅夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The place where we had gotten off was an unstaffed station called <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="さくらおか">Sakuraoka</STYLE>, and there was nothing around it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If there was a culprit <STYLE ID="2" RUBY="かた">posing as</STYLE> the shinigami, a place as hard as possible for people to reach was better.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When the train had stopped at this station, we decided to get off here.<PG>
That we had come here, no one knew but us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No one else had gotten off at this station, either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡山.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
All around, it had gotten completely dark.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
True to the name Sakuraoka, the whole mountain was covered in cherry trees. [TN: Sakuraoka means 'cherry hill.']
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was no wind, no cars, no sign of people.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was only 'a presence of no presence,' and the moonlight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It was an unfamiliar station name, and I didn't really know whereabouts we were, either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡ベンチ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I led <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> by the hand and sat down on a bench that was rotting away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Since then, we had not exchanged a word.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> had not cried, nor shown any sign of being <STYLE ID="4" RUBY="おび">frightened</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Only, she had pressed her lips firmly shut and gazed out the train window as it grew dark.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> was looking all around, searching for something.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{MESON "500"}
And then, she let go of my hand and walked off to stand under one of the few streetlights.<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\砂利を歩く.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "VOICE" "1000" "5000" "PASS"}
Before long, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> came walking back this way with something in her hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
What she was holding in her hand was...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花木刀片手.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "T" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "death_sound1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n600\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-500\r\n5000\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n人物1\r\n3\r\n600\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n456\r\n人物1\r\n4\r\n-500\r\n0\r\nDEC\r\nPASS">
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Hey! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> came closer, holding a long, sturdy tree branch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">... no way...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had I been <STYLE ID="6" RUBY="だま">deceived</STYLE> after all?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Had it been a make-believe friendship?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or else―<PG>
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花横顔.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "2000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"This should be of at least a little use... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">If the shinigami won't listen to what I say... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">With this, I'll protect </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> sat down on the bench and gripped the branch tight.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It looked heavy, and hard.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I had jumped to conclusions, but it seemed that somewhere in my heart, I was still afraid of <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Whatever comes... I'm the one who'll protect you, no matter what!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> gripped the tree branch tight once more.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯バイブ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "700" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I heard the buzz of <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE>'s phone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"It's </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
She showed signs of hesitating a little over whether to answer.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき電話.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Yes... hel―"</STYLE><BR>
<STYLE ID="8">"Hello, </STYLE><STYLE ID="9">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">!? Where on earth are you!? And I can't get through to </STYLE><STYLE ID="10">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="8">'s phone either!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE>'s loud voice reached us over here, too.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
We were deep in the mountains, but it seemed the signal was reaching us.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... Right now, I'm with </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. Some place called Sakuraoka Station, I don't really know where. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">... is fine."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it's me, Natsumi. Right now, it's just the two of us, me and </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="8">"Thank goodness..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花うつむき.gal" "WAIT" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
And then, <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> switched it to speakerphone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, please tell me anything. I'm on your side no matter what, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right... I can trust </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">you</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"Thank you."</STYLE><PG>
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "日没廃校.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">"So, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you want to ask something, right? What should I tell you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"First, how much does </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> know?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I told her everything. That the one who killed </STYLE><STYLE ID="11">Natsumi's dad</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> was me. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">And that the culprit of the Megasawa City case, who has cursed six people to death so far, is me too. If you've been with the </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">police</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you already know, right?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"Yes, I know... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">But, I just can't believe that </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> is the culprit. Because, when you think about it, a lot of things are strange...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, you're saying that too...? Well, fine, have it that way... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">But, I guess I'd like to hear the reason you think so."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you think that before coming back to Motoki-cho, you cursed people to death three times―six people in all, right?</STYLE> <STYLE ID="3">That you</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">'re the culprit of the Megasawa City case."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah, so?"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"But both </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> and </STYLE><STYLE ID="13">Senpai's mother</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> had perfect alibis at the time. All three times, what's more. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">So the police just asked you some questions and that was the end of it; you never even became a possible suspect."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"And what about it...!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"So </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, you have the power to curse, and you can kill people in a way that won't get you arrested. That's what you're convinced of, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Really, you're such a pain...! What are you trying to say!"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There was a pause for a while, but <STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE> began to speak slowly, in a calm voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"From here on, it's nothing more than my guess, but... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">if it turns out to be right..."</STYLE><PG>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Really!</STYLE>
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Hurry up and say it!!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="7">"Please run away, right now."</STYLE>
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "83" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? Run away?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　We've already come all the way out to the deep mountains like this... why would we need to run any farther..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"This isn't just </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, it's </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7"> too! Both of you, please get away from there right now!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"If it were just </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, sure, but me too...?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">　Haha... What are you saying, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">. So Dad's going to curse me to death too?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> was trembling, but even so she scoffed.<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, the Megasawa City case, the one where you say you killed them with a curse... That was a murder case, plain and simple!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"All right, </STYLE><STYLE ID="7">Goto</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">, that's enough. I'm hanging up."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! Please, listen to me!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Knock it off! Why would Dad come after me too!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "強風.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
At that moment, a wind swept through this spot, where there had been no wind.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\fear1.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\sceneswitch2.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "5" "5" "0" "30"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\能面フラッシュ.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物2" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n1000\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<EVENT VALUE="MOTION\r\n789\r\n000\r\n11\r\n0\r\n0\r\nNORMAL\r\nPASS">
{DELETECG "000" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\桜岡ベンチ赤.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\春花バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="5">"Ah, ahh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What's wrong, </STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It's dangerous...! This place is extremely dangerous...!
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My instinct was ringing the alarm bell more violently than it ever had before...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="7">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">! Could it be that intuition of yours!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="7">　Come on, </STYLE><STYLE ID="12">Ojisan</STYLE><STYLE ID="7">, it's Sakuraoka Station! Go full speed!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="12">"A-all right...!"</STYLE>
{PLAYSND "SE\著作権フリー 商用利用可能 な 【効果音】パトカー　サイレン　警察　パトロール　ピーポー　２.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "800" "0"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
From the other end of the phone, I heard a <STYLE ID="12">man</STYLE>'s voice and a patrol car's siren.<PG>
<STYLE ID="5">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE><STYLE ID="5">, it's dangerous here! Let's run, quick!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
I pulled <STYLE ID="3">Haruka</STYLE> by the hand and stood up.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{QUAKESTOP "0"}
{PLAYSND "SE\ベンチ殴る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "000,人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "50" "50" "500" "30"}
{WAIT "500" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Right after that, there was the sound of the bench we had been sitting on being struck with a blunt weapon, and splitting.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
